0,'reject',160,'2025-03-07 15:29:01','2025-03-07 15:29:01',522),(32906,219,6,483,0,3,21,'2|3|4|5',0,6,1,'Dasho, this is to inform that, the Internal Audit along with the Statutory Auditor, conducted a field visit to Phuntsholing GPO from 23-26 February 2025 for sampling and inspection of the year ended 2024. Due to time constraints, IAU could cover up verifying of only Imprest parts.To ensure a comprehensive compliance audit, it is recommended to approve the deployment of Mr. Kinley Dorji to Phuntsholing to verify all documents related to revenue collection and deposits, as the last audit was conducted in February 2020. The verification for 2024 will be completed in full, while previous years will be reviewed on a sample basis.As per the annual work plan, Internal Audit is expected to complete the task by March 2025. The audit report on Phuntsholing will be put up in BAC during 1st Quarter BAC meeting, which will take place after the Statutory Auditor&#039;s exit meeting (date yet to be decided). Submitted for Dasho&#039;s kind review and approval as proposed please.',160,'2025-03-07 15:39:06','2025-03-07 15:39:06',522),(32907,NULL,2,165492,2,1,2,'1',2,2,1,'Expense Application Initiated',251,'2025-03-07 16:05:44','2025-03-07 16:05:44',NULL),(32908,251,2,165492,3,2,6,'2|4',2,2,1,'OFFICE IMPREST of GPO THIMPH',251,'2025-03-07 16:06:33','2025-03-07 16:06:33',NULL),(32909,147,6,483,0,4,8,'',0,21,0,'Approved as proposed sending Kinley Dorji to audit as submitted',219,'2025-03-07 16:10:43','2025-03-07 16:10:43',522),(32910,NULL,2,165520,2,1,2,'1',2,2,1,'Expense Application Initiated',125,'2025-03-07 16:19:34','2025-03-07 16:19:34',NULL),(32911,125,2,165520,3,2,6,'2|4',2,2,1,'For approval please.',125,'2025-03-07 16:20:16','2025-03-07 16:20:16',NULL),(32912,NULL,2,165530,2,1,2,'1',2,2,1,'Expense Application Initiated',125,'2025-03-07 16:27:58','2025-03-07 16:27:58',NULL),(32913,125,2,165530,3,2,6,'2|4',2,2,1,'For approval please',125,'2025-03-07 16:28:21','2025-03-07 16:28