 20 days. Further, his probation period will be extended by one month. Submitted for your kind directive, please.',141,'2025-05-22 10:40:21','2025-05-22 10:40:21',508),(38388,NULL,2,191325,2,1,2,'1',2,2,1,'Expense Application Initiated',190,'2025-05-22 10:44:26','2025-05-22 10:44:26',NULL),(38389,130,2,191009,2,4,4,'',5,3,0,'JV APPROVED',130,'2025-05-22 10:44:33','2025-05-22 10:44:33',NULL),(38390,190,2,191325,3,2,6,'2|4',2,2,1,'HOUSE RENT EXPENSES BOOKED FOR MAY 2025.',190,'2025-05-22 10:45:09','2025-05-22 10:45:09',NULL),(38391,NULL,5,191326,5,1,2,'9',5,2,1,'Expense Application Initiated',130,'2025-05-22 10:45:57','2025-05-22 10:45:57',NULL),(38392,NULL,5,191326,6,2,18,'3|4',5,2,1,'F/W FOR NA',130,'2025-05-22 10:46:12','2025-05-22 10:46:12',NULL),(38393,340,2,191325,5,3,3,'3|4',3,6,1,'checked ',340,'2025-05-22 10:47:21','2025-05-22 10:47:21',NULL),(38394,174,2,190799,5,3,3,'3|4',3,6,1,'Submitted for kind approval please.',174,'2025-05-22 10:48:26','2025-05-22 10:48:26',NULL),(38395,174,2,191076,5,3,3,'3|4',3,6,1,'Submitted for kind approval please.',174,'2025-05-22 10:49:08','2025-05-22 10:49:08',NULL),(38396,346,3,1301,0,12,8,'',0,21,0,'Approved as recommended following SRR 2024 norms and also base it on the genuineness too',219,'2025-05-22 10:50:09','2025-05-22 10:50:09',508),(38397,174,2,191085,2,3,10,'',3,6,0,'Rejected.',174,'2025-05-22 10:56:55','2025-05-22 10:56:55',NULL),(38398,174,2,191291,5,3,3,'3|4',3,6,1,'Submitted for kind approval please.',174,'2025-05-22 10:58:23','2025-05-22 10:58:23',NULL),(38399,NULL,2,191352,2,1,2,'1',2,2,1,'Expense Application Initiated',173,'2025-05-22 11:00:03','2025-05-22 11:00:03',NULL),(38400,173,2,191352,3,2,6,'2|4',2,2,1,'APPLIED',173,'2025-05-22 11:00:19','2025-05-22 11:00:19',NULL),(38401,174,2,191205,5,3,3,'3|4',3,6,1,'Submitted for kind approval please.',174,'2025-05-22 11:14:04','2025-05-22 11:14:04',NULL),(38402,174,2,191352,5,3,3,'3|4',3,6,1,'Submitted for kind approval please.',174,'2025-05-22 11:16:17','2025-05-2